- Preferential duty flags.
- Origin consistency checks.

## Dangerous goods

- UN number detection.
- MSDS requirement.
- Battery/chemical flags.
- Missing dangerous goods declaration.

## POPIA

- Data minimization.
- Access control.
- Audit logs.
- Retention rules.
- Deletion requests.

